        "reference": "John 2:1",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "And both Jesus was called, and his disciples, to the marriage.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 2:2",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "And when they wanted wine, the mother of Jesus saith unto him, They have no wine.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 2:3",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Jesus saith unto her, Woman, what have I to do with thee? mine hour is not yet come.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "JST John 2:4 … Woman, what wilt thou have me to do for thee? that will I do; for mine hour is not yet come. TG Woman."
