        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 2:8",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "When the ruler of the feast had tasted the water that was made wine, and knew not whence it was: (but the servants which drew the water knew;) the governor of the feast called the bridegroom,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "John 2:9",
        "book": "John",
        "chapter": 2,
        "verse": 9
      },
